- CASTING/HOOKED/REELING: elapsed ≥ 0, finite, wait is null. No upper bound (carryover).
- SETTLEMENT: wait is null, elapsed ≥ 0 finite.
- IDLE: event null, wait null, elapsed == 0.0.
- PAUSED → reject.

